<title>CANADA: Circuit World to buy Simmonds unit.</title>
<headline>Circuit World to buy Simmonds unit.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Circuit World Corp said on Tuesday it executed a letter of intent with Simmonds Capital Ltd to acquire all the shares of Simmonds' wholly owned subsidiary SCL Electronics Ltd.</p>
<p>Circuit World said the deal provides for the issuance of 125,000,000 shares of Circuit World for all the shares of SCL.</p>
<p>SCL had revenues for the six months ended June 30, 1996 of about C$40 million, while Circuit World had revenues of C$11.6 million for the same period, Circuit World said.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
